{
    "title": "Domino Dreams\u2122",
    "description": "Welcome to Domino Dreams!\r\nPlay this fun domino royal game created for Solitaire and Domino lovers. \r\nDiscover a new realm in the most captivating and innovative board game experience on the planet! \ud83d\udc51\r\n\r\nEmbark on a grand royal journey filled with fun and excitement, offering thousands of amazing levels for All Fives dominoes, Draw dominoes, and Block dominoes enthusiasts. \r\n\r\nSolve challenging puzzles by strategically emptying all the classic Domino bones in your hand, earning coins, and unlocking a multitude of new levels and thrilling adventures. Collaborate with King Richard's loyal peon staff to design, construct, harvest crops, and beautify his magnificent realm. Prepare for a surprising and wondrous road ahead, where the fun never ceases!\ud83d\udc51\r\n\r\nHelp the king and his Peon team overcome challenging obstacles and make sure the quest is fit for a king. Harvest your success by using your domino coins and prizes to design and build the kingdom and celebrate the love of the peon citizens for his royal highness, King Richard. \ud83d\udc51\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfc6 Domino Dreams features: \r\n- Construct limitless royal kingdoms with the assistance of your loyal peons, creating realms of unmatched grandeur.\r\n- Each new chapter comes with free coins, helpful boosters, surprising awards, challenging tasks and wonderful new gaming experience.\r\n- Engage in thrilling challenges as you masterfully match tiles, unlocking streak bonuses and paving your path to victory.\r\n- Ascend to new heights by completing levels and spinning the Superwheel, where exciting rewards await.\r\n- Unveil delightful surprises with each level, elevating your matching tiles gaming experience with unexpected twists and turns on the amazing board game.\r\n\r\nDomino Dreams is the right game for all Mexican train and solitaire tripeaks lovers! Solve challenging puzzles and help King Richard on his royal tour adventure! \r\nJust play and relax while you enjoy the game's amazing art experience.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udff0The challenging levels never end! Challenge your brain and have fun with online tiles gaming experience, perfect for casual players and competitive enthusiasts alike. \r\n\r\nGet ready to solve challenging and brain-teasing board game puzzles. \r\nExplore the kingdom and unlock more and more levels, grand challenges, and new worlds to build, crops to harvest, design and decorate. \r\nTake care of the royal kingdom\u2019s towns, homes and gardens.\ud83c\udff0\r\n\r\nChallenge your skills with the exhilarating puzzle gaming experience of classic Dominoes board game. Rise through the ranks and claim your rightful place as the king of the Domino kingdom!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc51Uncover the majesty of the royal game of dominoes, introducing a thrilling and innovative way to indulge in the world's greatest board game! Play strategically to win coins and Gold Stars, accumulating treasures and enriching your royal treasury.\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udd47 Enhance and cultivate your mastery of the tiles, becoming the ultimate ruler of the board. Complete a series of tiles moves to win the special streak bonus and receive rewards, boosters and more coins! \r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc51Solve countless classic domino puzzles on this free to play board game and keep unlocking more levels of fun and enjoyment! The grand adventure awaits. Let your brain loose with this new neverending Domino game, download the game for free.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfafDomino Dreams is free on all devices with in-app purchases.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfafFollow Domino Dreams on Facebook for exclusive offers and bonuses!\r\nhttps://www.facebook.com/DominoDreams/\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfafAre you having problems? Please contact us via email at domino-help@superplay.co",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to Domino Dreams!<br>Play this fun domino royal game created for Solitaire and Domino lovers. <br>Discover a new realm in the most captivating and innovative board game experience on the planet! \ud83d\udc51<br><br>Embark on a grand royal journey filled with fun and excitement, offering thousands of amazing levels for All Fives dominoes, Draw dominoes, and Block dominoes enthusiasts. <br><br>Solve challenging puzzles by strategically emptying all the classic Domino bones in your hand, earning coins, and unlocking a multitude of new levels and thrilling adventures. Collaborate with King Richard&#39;s loyal peon staff to design, construct, harvest crops, and beautify his magnificent realm. Prepare for a surprising and wondrous road ahead, where the fun never ceases!\ud83d\udc51<br><br>Help the king and his Peon team overcome challenging obstacles and make sure the quest is fit for a king. Harvest your success by using your domino coins and prizes to design and build the kingdom and celebrate the love of the peon citizens for his royal highness, King Richard. \ud83d\udc51<br><br>\ud83c\udfc6 Domino Dreams features: <br>- Construct limitless royal kingdoms with the assistance of your loyal peons, creating realms of unmatched grandeur.<br>- Each new chapter comes with free coins, helpful boosters, surprising awards, challenging tasks and wonderful new gaming experience.<br>- Engage in thrilling challenges as you masterfully match tiles, unlocking streak bonuses and paving your path to victory.<br>- Ascend to new heights by completing levels and spinning the Superwheel, where exciting rewards await.<br>- Unveil delightful surprises with each level, elevating your matching tiles gaming experience with unexpected twists and turns on the amazing board game.<br><br>Domino Dreams is the right game for all Mexican train and solitaire tripeaks lovers! Solve challenging puzzles and help King Richard on his royal tour adventure! <br>Just play and relax while you enjoy the game&#39;s amazing art experience.<br><br>\ud83c\udff0The challenging levels never end! Challenge your brain and have fun with online tiles gaming experience, perfect for casual players and competitive enthusiasts alike. <br><br>Get ready to solve challenging and brain-teasing board game puzzles. <br>Explore the kingdom and unlock more and more levels, grand challenges, and new worlds to build, crops to harvest, design and decorate. <br>Take care of the royal kingdom\u2019s towns, homes and gardens.\ud83c\udff0<br><br>Challenge your skills with the exhilarating puzzle gaming experience of classic Dominoes board game. Rise through the ranks and claim your rightful place as the king of the Domino kingdom!<br><br>\ud83d\udc51Uncover the majesty of the royal game of dominoes, introducing a thrilling and innovative way to indulge in the world&#39;s greatest board game! Play strategically to win coins and Gold Stars, accumulating treasures and enriching your royal treasury.<br><br>\ud83e\udd47 Enhance and cultivate your mastery of the tiles, becoming the ultimate ruler of the board. Complete a series of tiles moves to win the special streak bonus and receive rewards, boosters and more coins! <br><br>\ud83d\udc51Solve countless classic domino puzzles on this free to play board game and keep unlocking more levels of fun and enjoyment! The grand adventure awaits. Let your brain loose with this new neverending Domino game, download the game for free.<br><br>\ud83c\udfafDomino Dreams is free on all devices with in-app purchases.<br><br>\ud83c\udfafFollow Domino Dreams on Facebook for exclusive offers and bonuses!<br>https://www.facebook.com/DominoDreams/<br><br>\ud83c\udfafAre you having problems? Please contact us via email at domino-help@superplay.co",
